# i18n

## Keys and locales

- Translation keys are the **English source string** (e.g. `t('Timer saved')`).
- Add matching entries in both `packages/app/src/lib/locales/en.json` and `nl.json` for app strings.
- Do not hardcode user-visible UI copy outside `t` / `translate`.

## Which API

| Context | Use |
| --- | --- |
| App Svelte components | `useI18n()` / `t()` |
| App non-Svelte modules | `translate()` from `$lib/i18n` |
| Plugin Svelte UI | `app.i18n.t` |
| Plugin TS modules | `app.i18n.translate` |

Plugins must **not** import `$lib/i18n` — use `app.i18n` only.

## Definitions

Handler/trigger **names** and field labels are English literals today (definition IDs / docs generator). Do not invent a parallel i18n system for them unless an existing pattern already does.

## Interpolation

```ts
app.i18n.translate('Edit {name}', { name: this.name });
```
